{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"feel\": \"开头有一种郑重，甚至带着骄傲，却很快透出惆怅和茫然。其间又有温柔的眷恋，像是仍能感到某种亲近，却无法真正安下心来。到末尾，迟疑中渐渐生出一点迫切，仍没有十足的把握。\",\n  \"thread\": \"有些东西，一想到便仍觉得珍贵，值得为它抬起头。但心里还看重它，不等于此刻仍能踏踏实实地拥有它。那份骄傲因此带着失落：他知道自己不愿舍弃什么，却一时说不清自己如今与它还有多近。偶尔感到的亲切让他舍不得放开，随之而来的陌生又使他不能安心。这样反复靠近，虽然没有得到确定的答案，却让他越来越难以只把它当作一份怀念；那份郑重渐渐有了想要切实回应的迫切。\",\n  \"used\": \"无\",\n  \"new\": [\n    \"有一种值得珍视、足以使人感到骄傲的东西，但人眼下与它的关系并不稳固。\",\n    \"它并未完全失去亲切感，因此失落并不意味着已经放下，眷恋也不意味着仍能安心拥有。\",\n    \"反复靠近没有带来确定的答案，却使原本带着怀念的珍重逐渐成为眼下难以搁置的牵挂。\"\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": \"无\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "48c2d02d-6c3a-481c-b16f-4e04fa7dc741", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T223941664332Z", "elapsed_seconds": 114.875, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:41:36.550762+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a1281d1b9c6858499fbe471d0d93603e7c480ffa2c15da30bf6a816611cdbcf6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31